          "qualifiedTypeId": "game.core.world.location",
          "value": {
            "kind": "settlement",
            "summary": "Aurent spans both banks of the Aur with broad quays, palaces, law schools, grain exchanges, shaded courts, and public fountains. River cases can make or end political careers.",
